---
title: "One-Pan Orzo with Spinach and Feta"
servings: 5
yield_verified: true
planner_ready: true
source: "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1021941-one-pan-orzo-with-spinach-and-feta"
repository: "https://github.com/nicholaswilde/recipes/blob/main/cook/mediterranean/One-Pan%20Orzo%20with%20Spinach%20and%20Feta.cook"
author: "Melissa Clark"
site: "GitHub · nicholaswilde/recipes"
